<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS1" title="In 5 Improving Multilingual Calibration ‣ Beyond the Final Layer: Intermediate Representations for Better Multilingual Calibration in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.1 </span>Multilingual Calibration Methods</span></a>
